    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy your friends online in Salvo Subs, a top-down shooter inspired by retro and arcade classics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 unlockable submarine vessels; each equipped with a unique combination of weapons and utilities. Over 80 items to pickup and launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ arena zones featuring various game modes for up to 9 teams: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asteroidea - Starfish boss rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atrium - Arctic compact deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Band-o-Bomb - Sportsball push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Borotron - Wave survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dirgible Danger - Low friction King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dueling Ring - Elimination duel </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eden - Serpent boss + minions and fortresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Floral Harbor - Mothership assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gnat Citadel - Dungeon crawler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lazy Racer - Loop race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Titleport - Portal deathmatch</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host and admin your own LAN-friendly server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer music by Xyce.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy your friends online in Salvo Subs, a top-down shooter inspired by retro and arcade classics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 unlockable submarine vessels; each equipped with a unique combination of weapons and utilities. Over 80 items to pickup and launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ arena zones featuring various game modes for up to 9 teams: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asteroidea - Starfish boss rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atrium - Arctic compact deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Band-o-Bomb - Sportsball push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Borotron - Wave survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dirgible Danger - Low friction King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dueling Ring - Elimination duel </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eden - Serpent boss + minions and fortresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Floral Harbor - Mothership assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gnat Citadel - Dungeon crawler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lazy Racer - Loop race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Titleport - Portal deathmatch</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host and admin your own LAN-friendly server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer music by Xyce.</p>",
